      <rules>
        <rule name="Fabricatus-Primus" id="c146-066e-46a5-ad10" page="16" publicationId="f856-58d6-ef02-7d3e">
          <description>Kelbor-Hal has the Artificia Machina, Artificia Cybernetica, and Ephemera Incursus Cybertheurgic Arcana, and has all Rites and weapons that are part of those Arcana. Kelbor-Hal also possesses a unique Cybertheurgic Weapon - Exiguo Maelifica.
In addition, Kelbor-Hal has the Bonds of Vassalage and Master Technomancer Special Rules (see page 98, Liber Mechanicum).</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
