    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Order of Lesser Techno-Arcana: Lachrimallion" hidden="false" id="6f0f-b92d-4285-a96a" publicationId="f856-58d6-ef02-7d3e" page="85">
      <rules>
        <rule name="Order of Lesser Techno-Arcana: Lachrimallion" id="eaf3-e2be-84df-2466" publicationId="f856-58d6-ef02-7d3e" page="85" hidden="false">
          <description>A model with this Special Rule gains the Opus Viscera and Incorruptible Flesh Special Rules (see page 99 of Liber Mechanicum).</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <constraints>
        <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="true" id="790d-5df6-023c-c931" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true"/>
      </constraints>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Order of Lesser Techno-Arcana: Macroteknia" hidden="false" id="3493-afdd-1cfd-dd1b" publicationId="f856-58d6-ef02-7d3e" page="85">
      <rules>
        <rule name="Order of Lesser Techno-Arcana: Macroteknia" id="b66e-ea41-9445-21e6" publicationId="f856-58d6-ef02-7d3e" page="85" hidden="false">
          <description>A model with this Special Rule gains the Rector Aedificii (see page 100 of Liber Mechanicum) and the Machinatus Primus Special Rules.
Machinatus Primus: Before deployment, the Controlling Player may select a single vehicle from the same detachment as a model with this Special Rule. If the vehicle is part of a squadron, only a single model gains the bonus – this must be clearly marked somehow. The vehicle may not have the Knight or Titan Sub-types.
That vehicle gains +2 to its Movement Characteristic, and +1 to its Hull Points Characteristic.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <constraints>
        <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="true" id="bd1b-8db4-401d-7cb2" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true"/>
      </constraints>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Order of Lesser Techno-Arcana: Malaghrae" hidden="false" id="38c9-bee0-4bd9-d5df" publicationId="f856-58d6-ef02-7d3e" page="85">
      <rules>
        <rule name="Order of Lesser Techno-Arcana: Malaghrae" id="1c09-4039-2b60-3768" publicationId="f856-58d6-ef02-7d3e" page="85" hidden="false">
          <description>A model with this Special Rule gains Mech-Assassin Special Rule.
Mech-Assassin: A model with this Special Rule gains the Preferred Enemy (Characters), Precision Strikes (6+), and the Monster Hunter Special Rules.
In addition, a model with this special rule increases their Weapon Skill Characteristic to 5 and Attacks Characteristic to 3, and is equipped with a Prehensile Dataspike. A model with this Special Rule may exchange a single Power Weapon they are armed with for a Paragon Blade for +20 points.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <constraints>
        <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="true" id="ef9b-d809-f2cb-41f8" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true"/>
      </constraints>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Order of Lesser Techno-Arcana: Myrmidae" hidden="false" id="742d-a196-f79d-ece5" publicationId="f856-58d6-ef02-7d3e" page="85">
      <rules>
        <rule name="Order of Lesser Techno-Arcana: Myrmidae" id="2c13-1a29-50d5-8a65" publicationId="f856-58d6-ef02-7d3e" page="85" hidden="false">
          <description>A model with this Special Rule gains the Hatred (Everything!), Bulky (3), Firing Protocols (3), and Precision Shots (6+) Special Rules. In addition, a model with this Order of Lesser Techno-Arcana changes its Wounds Characteristic to 4.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <constraints>
        <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="true" id="fe6a-92b8-c268-6f2d" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true"/>
      </constraints>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Order of Lesser Techno-Arcana: Ruinor" hidden="false" id="8ebb-63cd-9d1b-93ec" publicationId="f856-58d6-ef02-7d3e" page="85">
      <rules>
        <rule name="Order of Lesser Techno-Arcana: Ruinor" id="92f2-038a-2fba-bc4c" publicationId="f856-58d6-ef02-7d3e" page="85" hidden="false">
          <description>A model with this Special Rule gains the Wrecker, Sunder, and Secrets of Annihilation Special Rules (see page 101 of Liber Mechanicum), and also gains the Cybertheurgist Sub-type. In addition, any unit a model with this Lesser Order of Techno-Arcana joins also gains the benefit of the Wrecker and Sunder Special Rules for as long as they are in the unit.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <constraints>
        <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="true" id="59fa-e4bb-46fa-3d5a" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true"/>
      </constraints>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Module Slot (used)" hidden="false" id="e654-fa8e-57ef-fef7">
      <constraints>
        <constraint type="max" value="4" field="selections" scope="3142-53ad-4a7d-8790" shared="true" id="c63e-46e7-e17b-907d" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/>
      </constraints>
    </selectionEntry>
